        {
          "end_index": 97,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 3,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 52,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2051186130842818270"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 26
        }
      ],
      "pid": "2iSPZJve",
      "text": "社会只宽容脱轨成功者，脱轨失败者连喘气的资格都没有。一个不宽容失败的社会，本质上是在对所有人说：要么 100% 成功，要么别碰。于是大部分人选择不碰，选最安全的路走，圈子里剩下的都是贾浅浅之流："
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 25,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 16,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2051117585232566077"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 4
        }
      ],
      "pid": "Ph10Bg36",
      "text": "影视圈，欺世盗名的人互相吹捧，评奖靠圈子不靠作品。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 69,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 15,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2051406832070137336"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 16
        }
      ],
      "pid": "abRIAUue",
      "text": "饺子没入围百花奖，只是冰山一角：不光是奖项黑，是整个社会从来就没给过脱轨者好脸色。哪怕你最后成功了，也是「幸运的异类」，被嫉妒你的人排挤。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 41,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 3,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 20,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2051814790180483224"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 4
        }
      ],
      "pid": "g1cmFFqi",
      "text": "结果呢？做题能做出名堂的人注定只有那么多，大多数人的努力只是在为筛选系统提供分母。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 76,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 1,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 15,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2050928481668691197"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 12
        }
      ],
      "pid": "9Y5xdaWC",
      "text": "创业的九死一生，是明牌。所有人都知道失败概率 90% 以上，失败被默认是常态。而做题的九死一生，被包装成「公平竞争」，让大多数人误以为只要够努力就能赢。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 79,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 7,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2050928505114960388"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 7
        }
      ],
      "pid": "6Yn6_BSC",
      "text": "很多人不能接受「做题也是幸存者偏差」，因为一旦接受，他们就必须承认：自己和那些被他们嘲笑的「脱轨失败者」一样，也是在一个「注定大多数人失败」的系统中浪费青春。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 36,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 14,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2051759474529063381"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 6
        }
      ],
      "pid": "MYNqPNpl",
      "text": "区别只在于，脱轨者至少敢于选择自己的赌局，而做题家连赌桌都是别人安排的。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 77,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 8,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2051597728598304316"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "pid": "OuSQ_y0p",
      "text": "创业失败者，为社会排除了错误路径：这个细分市场不存在、那个技术路线走不通、这种商业模式没有利润。客观上，他们排除了错误的路线，没人需要重复踩他们踩过的坑。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 66,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 8,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2051597754363913187"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "pid": "IsM9i3Mr",
      "text": "做题陪跑者，只为社会提供了「失败者」的样本：做题家的失败案例（比如高考陪跑）能排除什么？什么也排除不了，因为那条路本就是重复已知路线。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 19,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 7,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2052820384420979558"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "pid": "JnXF6XcT",
      "text": "前者的失败有价值，而后者只是代价而已。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 35,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 4,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2051597771950576698"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 3
        }
      ],
      "pid": "DGdRfmi4",
      "text": "所以，真正值得尊敬的，不是「成功」，而是「下场选择并承担后果」的勇气。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 36,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 5,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2051759907720934328"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "pid": "H8d6wacU",
      "text": "如果所有人都因为害怕失败而不敢「脱轨」，那不只是饺子这样的人永远不会出现，甚至，科技创新永远都不会发生，文化艺术永远都不会繁荣。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 43,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 2,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2051636689706168328"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "pid": "DpwMPfo-",
      "text": "饺子、刘慈欣只是零星的幸存者。但零星的幸存者，撑不起一个 14 亿人口大国的文化底气。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 64,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 3,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2052820541191542327"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "pid": "PzzZfbau",
      "text": "什么时候我们对一个脱轨失败的人能说「没关系，至少尝试过」，而不是「你看，我早就说吧」，什么时候真正优质的文化产品才会批量长出来。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 27,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 1,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 3,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2051738095096160418"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 11
        }
      ],
      "pid": "8Qi9iiz8",
      "text": "在那之前呢？先烂着吧。没有土壤，就别问庄稼为什么不长。"
    }
  ],
